      "name": "LIHEAP (Low-Income Home Energy Assistance Program)",
      "shortName": "Home Energy Assistance",
      "tagline": "If your parent pays their own electric or gas bill in Louisiana and earns under $30,618/year as a single person, they may qualify for up to $800 toward that bill.",
